   "lines": [
    "Travelled all day through",
    "the wooded hills of",
    "Pensylvania and the",
    "rolling prairies of",
    "Ohio. It is great",
    "fun to be off",
    "with old Nell; he",
    "and I can do about",
    "anything together; we",
    "never lose our",
    "temper under diffi-",
    "culties and always",
    "accomplish what we",
    "set about."
   ],
